{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Well, how'd it go?\nFind anything between Kajihira and Kazami?": "",
  "Sure. How'd it go?\nFind anything between Kajihira and Kazami?": "",
  "Heh, just a couple of rumors, really.": "",
  "Heh... just a couple of rumors.": "",
  "Then what's with that grin?": "",
  "And yet you're grinning.": "",
  "Fine, you got me. You know that meeting they had?\nTurns out it was about the ADDC.": "",
  "Yeah. See, Kajihira and Kazami? They had a\nnice little meeting about the ADDC.": "",
  "For years now, the Kajihira Group has been secretly\nplanning an absolutely massive redevelopment project.": "",
  "For years now, the Kajihira Group has been secretly planning\nan absolutely massive redevelopment project.": "",
  "And where were they planning it?\nThis plot of land right here.": "",
  "Up in the city. A huge plot of land...\nCheck it out.": "",
  "That's the ADDC.": "",
  "Yup. The area around it, too.": "",
  "Not just their building.\nThe whole damn area.": "",
  "To be precise, Kajihira wanted all the land\nbelonging to the Medical Institute.": "",
  "Kajihira wanted all the land belonging to\nthe Medical Device Development Institute.": "",
  "Which, as you know, is managed by none\nother than the Ministry of Health.": "",
  "And, they're managed by none other\nthan the Ministry of Health.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So Kajihira's redevelopment plan was premised on\ngetting land from the Ministry of Health...)</color>": "",
  "That explains why Kajihira\nneeded to talk to Minister Kazami.": "",
  "So for Kajihira's plan to work,\nhe needed to go through Minister Kazami.": "",
  "If they want to go forward with the redevelopment,\nthey'll have to shut the Institute down. Including the ADDC.": "",
  "If they want to redevelop, they'll have to\nshut the Institute down. And the ADDC with it.": "",
  "But is getting just one bigwig\non board with the project enough?": "",
  "And that's all he needs?\nTo convince this one guy?": "",
  "It is in this case. Apparently Kazami was already\nplanning to shut the center down.": "",
  "It is in this case.\nApparently Kazami was already planning to shut it down.": "",
  "See, the Institute was created with the goal of addressing Japan's\naging population problem. Too many seniors, not enough babies, all that.": "",
  "See, the Institute was created for the specific purpose\nof addressing Japan's aging population.": "",
  "But for the past ten years,\nthe money's been going into a black hole.": "",
  "But over the past ten years it's been\nnothing but a black hole.": "",
  "People even call it a tax scam.": "",
  "People even started calling them tax thieves.": "",
  "I mean, they're not wrong. Management's just\na buncha crusty government types.": "",
  "And hey, management's mostly old ex-government\nofficials. So not too far off.": "",
  "I see. So if the Minister of Health\nsays that time's up...": "",
  "I see. So, if the Minister of Health\nsays their time's up...": "",
  "Bye bye, ADDC, hello giant plot of land.": "",
  "They'd tear it down in a heartbeat.": "",
  "Wouldn't that reflect poorly on Kazami, though?": "",
  "Wouldn't that reflect poorly on the Minister?": "",
  "Maybe, but I doubt he'd mind so long\nas he got a nice kickback from it.": "",
  "As long as he gets a kickback,\nwould he even care?": "",
  "And that's exactly what Kajihira put on the table.\nI'm sure it was enough to cover the damage.": "",
  "So yeah, Kajihira found the Minister,\nand gave him exactly what he wanted.": "",
  "A big ol' bribe, basically.": "",
  "Straight-up bribery.": "",
  "On top of that, Kajihira bought up all the land\naround the Center years back to avoid rising prices.": "",
  "On top of that, Kajihira bought up all the land\naround the Center years back, to avoid rising prices.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(All he needed was the Ministry of Health's\ngo ahead.)</color>": "",
  "They're not even trying to hide it.": "",
  "Yup, But as luck would have it...\nIt just wasn't meant to be.": "",
  "Yup. Still, I guess it just\nwasn't meant to be.": "",
  "One day, Kajihira's redevelopment project\nsuddenly got flushed down the drain.": "",
  "One day, Kajihira's redevelopment project\nsuddenly went down the drain.": "",
  "Something happened preventing\nthe ADDC from closing.": "",
  "The ADDC was suddenly\ntoo big to shut down.": "",
  "And it's all thanks to this guy.": "",
  "All thanks to this.": "",
  "Kido and his AD-9 research.": "",
  "They announced AD-9's development.": "",
  "Yup, you don't just shut down a dementia drug\nthat could change the world.": "",
  "Yeah. Can't shut down a dementia drug\nthat might change the world.": "",
  "So, Kazami started singing AD-9's praises to anyone\nwho'd listen. And you know how it ends.": "",
  "So Kazami started singing AD-9's praises\nto anyone who'd listen.": "",
  "The ADDC stayed in business, the money kept flowing,\nthe research kept going.": "",
  "Naturally, they decided to keep\nthe ADDC up and running.": "",
  "Kazami brushed the whole deal under the rug.": "",
  "They pretended the deal with Kajihira\nnever even happened.": "",
  "And pulled it right out from under Kajihira.": "",
  "Kajihira...\nMinister Kazami really screwed him, huh.": "",
  "Yup. Guy must've lost billions in the process.\nWonder what that feels like?": "",
  "Yup. He must have invested billions.\nSo much for mutual benefit, right?": "",
  "I'd guess he's not too happy with this AD-9 business.": "",
  "I'd guess he's not too happy\nwith this AD-9 stuff.": "",
  "Right. How'd you get all this, anyway?": "",
  "Guess not.\nBy the way, how'd you dig all this up?": "",
  "I literally asked you today.": "",
  "I only just asked you today.": "",
  "Ah, you wanna look behind the curtain, huh?": "",
  "Ah...\nGuess I should tell you, huh?": "",
  "It's not that impressive.\nIt was all published online last year.": "",
  "All that stuff I just told you was actually published\nin an article online, last year.": "",
  "It was a pretty gripping article,\nbut they couldn't substantiate their claims.": "",
  "It made some pretty hefty claims,\nbut nothing it could substantiate, of course.": "",
  "Everyone wrote it off as tabloid nonsense.": "",
  "Everyone just wrote it off as gossip.": "",
  "I think they might've been right.": "",
  "If you ask me...\nthey might've been right.": "",
  "What, why?": "",
  "The piece is by Ko Hattori.": "",
  "This was written by a journalist\nnamed Hattori.": "",
  "And he's an asshole.": "",
  "Not exactly reputable.": "",
  "What, you know him?": "",
  "You know him?": "",
  "Yeah, we go back. And apparently he stormed\nGenda's office today looking for an interview.": "",
  "Yeah. Apparently he stormed into\nGenda's office earlier, too.": "",
  "Huh!? Doesn't that mean\nyou can ask him yourself?": "",
  "Huh...? Hey, so you can go ask him yourself!": "",
  "You better get a move on!": "",
  "You'd better get going.": "",
  "Guess I'll have to.": "",
  "...Eh, fine.\nDon't have much choice.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Kajihira has lost a ton of money\nbecause of this ADDC business.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Does that have anything to do with\nwhy Shintani and those Kyorei guys got murdered?)</color>": "",
  "Oh hey, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Is Hattori still here?": "",
  "Where's Hattori?": "",
  "No, he actually left a while ago.": "",
  "He already left some time ago.": "",
  "Oh yeah? You really did scare\nhim off then, huh?": "",
  "Really. Guess you really did\nscare him off, huh?": "",
  "More like he couldn't handle Saori-san\nstaring into his soul.": "",
  "Not exactly... He couldn't handle\nSaori-san staring into his soul.": "",
  "Who can?": "",
  "Makes sense... Who could?": "",
  "By the way, um...": "",
  "Mafuyu?": "",
  "I came to offer condolences\nfor Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "I came to offer my condolences for\nShintani-sensei.": "",
  "That's not the only reason.\nTell Yagami-san straight.": "",
  "That's not the only reason you're here, is it?\nYou should just tell Yagami-san directly.": "",
  "Something you needed to say?": "",
  "You wanted to say something?": "",
  "Yes, well...": "",
  "Izumida wants to take you in, Yagami-kun.\nFor Shintani-sensei's murder.": "",
  "Does he? A detective by the name of Kuroiwa\nsaid I was a material witness, too.": "",
  "Aha. A detective by the name of Kuroiwa\nwas trying to say I'm a material witness, too.": "",
  "What is going on, Yagami-kun?": "",
  "What's going on here?": "",
  "Hey, I could ask you the same thing.": "",
  "You're asking me?\nI'd like to know the same thing.": "",
  "Just to be sure...\nYou didn't do it, did you?": "",
  "Just to be sure, Yagami-kun...\nYou didn't do it, did you?": "",
  "Me, kill Shintani?": "",
  "Me, kill Shintani!?": "",
  "Of course I didn't.\nHow could you even ask?": "",
  "Of course I didn't.\nI'm offended you'd even ask.": "",
  "I'm a prosecutor, remember?\nDoubting people is my job.": "",
  "I can't help it—I'm a prosecutor.\nIt's my job to doubt people.": "",
  "So. Why's Izumida suspect me?\nDoes he even have anything to go on?": "",
  "So. Why does Izumida suspect me?\nDoes he have any evidence?": "",
  "I'm not sure. They're leaving me out of the loop\non purpose I think. But even Morita-san suspects you.": "",
  "I'm not sure. They kind of left me out of the loop.\nBut from the sounds of it, even Morita-san suspects you.": "",
  "They really don't like me, huh?": "",
  "I don't think they can charge you with a murder\non the grounds of \"not liking you\", Yagami-kun.": "",
  "I don't think they would suspect you of murder\nbecause of something so simple as \"not liking you\".": "",
  "Well, either way,\nI'm glad you didn't kill anyone.": "",
  "Either way,\nI'm glad you didn't do it, Yagami-kun.": "",
  "But if anything comes up...\nfeel free to get in touch.": "",
  "If it's within my power,\nI'll do what I can to help.": "",
  "I would be happy to help if I can.": "",
  "Thanks, Mafuyu.": "",
  "See you later. Say goodbye\nto Genda-sensei for me.": "",
  "Time to go.\nSay hi to Genda-sensei for me.": "",
  "I guess Genda-sensei\ntook the day off today.": "",
  "Well... It seems Genda-sensei\ntook the day off today.": "",
  "He must be taking Shintani-sensei's\ndeath pretty hard...": "",
  "He must be taking Shintani-sensei's death\npretty hard...": "",
  "Go talk to Mafuyu.": "",
  "(Guess I should hear what\nMafuyu has to say.)": "",
  "Did Sugiura-san end up finding anything?\nWhat's the latest?": "",
  "What about Sugiura-san? Any word?\nDid he find anything?": "",
  "He did.": "",
  "Apparently Kajihira was trying to get\nKazami to close down the ADDC.": "",
  "Apparently Kajihira tried to get Kazami\nto close the ADDC.": "",
  "Wait, what!?": "",
  "Hm...? What!?": "",
  "He wanted to use the Center's land\nfor his redevelopment project.": "",
  "Kajihira wanted the Center's land for his\nredevelopment project.": "",
  "But then the AD-9 research came out and threw a wrench\ninto things. Kajihira lost a lot of money.": "",
  "But the AD-9 research coming out threw a wrench\nin things. Kajihira lost a lot of money.": "",
  "Wait a second... That means he's connected\ndirectly to the ADDC!": "",
  "Wait... Then Kajihira and the ADDC—\nThey've been connected this whole time!?": "",
  "According to Hattori's article, at least.": "",
  "Hattori-san wrote about it?": "",
  "Hattori-san...? He was just here.": "",
  "That's why I stopped by.\nI wanted to ask him about it in person.": "",
  "So he hangs around when you don't want him,\nand then when you need him he's nowhere in sight...": "",
  "I see! Guess he's only ever around\nwhen you don't want him to be.": "",
  "Guy's the worst, seriously.": "",
  "Seriously, that guy's the worst.": "",
  "Yagami-san?\nIt's Sugiura.": "",
  "Uh, did a woman just leave that\noffice you hang around in?": "",
  "Hey, did a woman just leave\nthe Genda office?": "",
  "Hm? Oh, you must mean Mafuyu.": "",
  "Hm?\nOh, you must mean Mafuyu.": "",
  "Oh, I didn't know her name.\nShe's pretty though.": "",
  "Not sure what her name is.\nGirl's pretty, though.": "",
  "Wait, does that mean you've been\nfollowing me?": "",
  "What's going on...?\nAre you following me?": "",
  "I'll tell you later. I'd worry more about\nall the yakuza tailing Mafuyu-san.": "",
  "I'll tell you later. Right now, what matters is\nthe yakuza tailing Mafuyu-san.": "",
  "Yeah, it's like four yakuza, maybe more.": "",
  "Looks like four yakuza goons.\nCould be more nearby.": "",
  "What should I do?\nWe should do something, right?": "",
  "What should I do?\nWe have to do <font_kind=yakuza_italic>something</font_kind>, right?": "",
  "I'll be right there.\nWhere are you?": "",
  "Head straight to Theater Square\nonce you're down.": "",
  "Head to Theater Avenue once you\nstep out of the office.": "",
  "And be quick about it, yeah?\nI can't take 'em all by myself, Yagami-san!": "",
  "And do it quick, Yagami-san.\nI can't handle this on my own!": "",
  "You coming, Yagami-san?\nWhere are you?": "",
  "Yagami-san, you coming?\nWhere are you?": "",
  "I just left Genda's office.\nHow's Mafuyu?": "",
  "Just left Genda's office.\nHow's Mafuyu?": "",
  "Fine for now... but maybe not much longer.\nThose yakuza are getting closer by the minute.": "",
  "Fine for now... but maybe not much longer.\nThey're getting closer to Mafuyu-san by the minute.": "",
  "You've gotta hurry, Yagami-san.\nShe's just about to cross Theater Square.": "",
  "Are you there, Yagami-san?\nMafuyu just went left down Theater Avenue.": "",
  "Are you there, Yagami-san?\nMafuyu just hung a left down Theater Avenue.": "",
  "Got it, thanks.": "",
  "Okay, got it.": "",
  "She's got even more yakuza on her tail now.\nIt's way more than four by my count.": "",
  "But she's got even more yakuza on her tail now.\nIt's not just four anymore.": "",
  "Are they on her about some yakuza related case?\nWhat family are they from?": "",
  "Yakuza following a prosecutor?\nWhat family are they from?": "",
  "I haven't figured that out.\nBetter to just get over to her, quick!": "",
  "I can't tell yet.\nJust hurry up and get over here!": "",
  "Yo, road's closed, pal.": "",
  "Hey, hold it right there, pal!": "",
  "You're Yagami, yeah?": "",
  "I don't have time for this!": "",
  "I don't have time for this.": "",
  "Afraid that's not your call. We've got an appointment\nwith the lady prosecutor, y'see.": "",
  "That ain't a decision you get to make.\nWe got an appointment with that prosecutor broad.": "",
  "You heard me, asshole.\nNow step the fuck back, or else!": "",
  "Hrgh... Dammit!": "",
  "Hrgh...\nDammit!": "",
  "Who are you?\nAnd why are you following Mafuyu!?": "",
  "Heh, don't think we're givin'\nup that easy!": "",
  "It ain't over yet...\nWe're not givin' up!": "",
  "Yo! Need a hand, Tak?": "",
  "Yo. Need a hand, Tak?": "",
  "Oh, Kaito-san.": "",
  "I'm kinda bummed you started the party\nwithout me, man. I'm raring to go.": "",
  "I'm kinda bummed you started the party without me, man.\nI'm raring to go.": "",
  "Wh-What!?": "",
  "Not a second too late. Mind taking care\nof these guys? I've gotta get after Mafuyu.": "",
  "Right on time. You handle these guys.\nI've gotta go save Mafuyu. ": "",
  "Mafuyu-chan?\nShe's not in trouble is she?": "",
  "Mafuyu-chan?\nWho're these chumps?": "",
  "Handle it, please! See ya.": "",
  "Just do it! See you soon!": "",
  "I get it.\nYou guys are tailing Mafuyu-chan.": "",
  "I get it now.\nYou guys are tailin' Mafuyu-chan, huh?": "",
  "I can't exactly let that\nkinda shit slide, assholes.": "",
  "I can't exactly let that kinda shit\nslide, y'know.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "What, why?": "หา ทำไมล่ะ?",
  "You know him?": "นายรู้จักเขาเหรอ?",
  "You'd better get going.": "นายรีบไปซะดีกว่า",
  "Yes, well...": "อ๋อ คือว่า...",
  "What's going on here?": "นี่มันเรื่องอะไรกัน?",
  "Wait, what!?": "เดี๋ยว อะไรนะ!?",
  "Got it, thanks.": "เข้าใจแล้ว ขอบใจนะ",
  "Okay, got it.": "โอเค เข้าใจแล้ว",
  "I don't have time for this.": "ฉันไม่มีเวลาสำหรับเรื่องนี้",
  "Wh-What!?": "อ-อะไรนะ!?"
 }
}
